      "description": "Watch Fortuna Sittard vs Cambuur highlights and goals from Eredivisie on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 15, 2026. On August 15, 2026, fans gathered for an Eredivisie encounter that promised tactical intrigue and high-intensity football. Both sides took to the pitch with clear intentions, setting the stage for a contest defined by early clinical finishing and late-game drama. Rapid Start in Sittard The home side, Fortuna Sittard , took immediate control of the narrative. Only six minutes had elapsed when Mohammed Ihattaren delivered a precise corner, allowing Philip Brittijn to rise highest and head the ball home for the opening goal. The momentum stayed firmly with the hosts, and by the 15th minute, the lead was doubled. Jasper Dahlhaus turned provider for Lequincio Zeefuik , who found the back of the net with a composed right-footed finish to put Fortuna Sittard in a commanding position. Cambuur Fight Back Despite the early setback, Cambuur refused to fold. They began to dominate possession, eventually controlling 64% of the ball. Their persistence paid off in the 22nd minute through a wonderful team goal; Nicky Souren teed up Rafik El Arguioui , who slotted a right-footed shot home to halve the deficit. Cambuur continued to threaten, with Sami Bouhoudane forcing a comfortable save from Mattijs Branderhorst before the break, as the visitors searched desperately for an equalizer. VAR Drama and the Final Blow The second half was a tighter affair characterized by tactical substitutions and increasing physical play. Nicky Souren and Lucas Jetten both picked up yellow cards as the tension rose. In the 91st minute, the stadium held its breath as a VAR check was conducted for a potential Cambuur penalty. However, the referee ruled no foul, much to the relief of the 9,547 spectators in attendance. Deep into stoppage time, at 90+6', Fortuna Sittard finally put the game to bed. After an offside scare just a minute earlier, Shiloh Zand made no mistake when played in by Ivo Pinto and Edouard Michut . Zand's right-footed strike secured the 3-1 victory, rewarding Fortuna Sittard for their resilience against a ball-dominant Cambuur side."
